      "summary": "<figure><img alt=\"晓数点｜一图速览5月A股月报\" src=\"https://imgcdn.yicai.com/uppics/slides/2026/05/a95be40dbfca301e9321b5bd111a19e6.jpg\" /></figure><p>四大指数走势互异，长盈通问鼎月度牛股，A股“股王”频繁易主，主力大幅抛售东山精密&gt;&gt;</p><p align=\"center\"><img align=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://imgcdn.yicai.com/uppics/images/2026/05/6b3fb2b010d1f560f6201d7de6ac0e3c.jpg\" style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; width: 800px; height: 1362px;\" /></p>",
